1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,700
Every business begins with an idea.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,860
But somewhere along the way… things get complicated.

3
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,940
It isn't the people. It's everything that doesn't connect.

4
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:56,060
Different tools. Different files. Endless workarounds.

5
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:02,720
What if your business could simply show the system how it works?

6
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:09,560
Don't change the way your business works…
Build the software around it.

7
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:32,860
Film how you work. It finds your records, your steps and your rules —
and shows you where it heard them.

8
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:36,340
Your rules become guardrails the system enforces.

9
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:48,040
Ask for a change in one sentence. Or simply record again.

10
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:57,300
With Plus: reports, calendar and webhook connections, team roles and invoicing.
And you're never on your own.

11
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:11,200
Same company. Same people. Finally connected.

12
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:22,180
Code Your Reality. Your processes. Your software.
